{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":60,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷未來的榮耀"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"興起，發光！因為你的光已經來到！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的榮耀發現照耀你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，黑暗遮蓋大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幽暗遮蓋萬民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華卻要顯現照耀你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的榮耀要現在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國要來就你的光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王要來就你發現的光輝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你舉目向四方觀看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾人都聚集來到你這裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眾子從遠方而來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眾女也被懷抱而來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，你看見就有光榮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你心又跳動又寬暢；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為大海豐盛的貨物必轉來歸你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的財寶也必來歸你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成群的駱駝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並米甸和以法的獨峰駝必遮滿你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"示巴的眾人都必來到；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要奉上黃金乳香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又要傳說耶和華的讚美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基達的羊群都必聚集到你這裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼拜約的公羊要供你使用，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我壇上必蒙悅納；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必榮耀我榮耀的殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"那些飛來如雲、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如鴿子向窗戶飛回的是誰呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾海島必等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首先是他施的船隻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將你的眾子連他們的金銀從遠方一同帶來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都為耶和華－你上帝的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又為以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他已經榮耀了你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"外邦人必建築你的城牆；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的王必服事你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾發怒擊打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現今卻施恩憐恤你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的城門必時常開放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晝夜不關；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人把列國的財物帶來歸你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並將他們的君王牽引而來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪一邦哪一國不事奉你，就必滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必全然荒廢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是松樹、杉樹、黃楊樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必一同歸你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為要修飾我聖所之地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要使我腳踏之處得榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"素來苦待你的，他的子孫都必屈身來就你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視你的，都要在你腳下跪拜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要稱你為「耶和華的城」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為「以色列聖者的錫安」。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"你雖然被撇棄被厭惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至無人經過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻使你變為永遠的榮華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為累代的喜樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也必吃萬國的奶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又吃君王的奶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你便知道我－耶和華是你的救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你的救贖主，雅各的大能者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我要拿金子代替銅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿銀子代替鐵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿銅代替木頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿鐵代替石頭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並要以和平為你的官長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公義為你的監督。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你地上不再聽見強暴的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內不再聽見荒涼毀滅的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必稱你的牆為「拯救」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"稱你的門為「讚美」。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"日頭不再作你白晝的光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"月亮也不再發光照耀你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華卻要作你永遠的光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你上帝要為你的榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的日頭不再下落；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的月亮也不退縮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華必作你永遠的光。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你悲哀的日子也完畢了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的居民都成為義人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠得地為業；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我種的栽子，我手的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我得榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至小的族要加增千倍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"微弱的國必成為強盛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我－耶和華要按定期速成這事。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/60.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/61.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/59.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}